# ── Map Pins UI (Vite) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Vite reads env from THIS folder (capabilities/geospatial/ui/). Copy to `.env` to override.
#
# Azure Maps subscription key for the browser map control. OPTIONAL: when unset, the dev server
# automatically reuses AZURE_MAPS_KEY from the repo-root .env (see vite.config.ts). Local dev only —
# a key set here is baked into the client bundle; production should use Azure Maps AAD anonymous auth.
# VITE_AZURE_MAPS_KEY=

# Where the Geospatial MCP server is reached (default below).
# VITE_GEOSPATIAL_MCP_URL=http://localhost:7076/api/mcp/geospatial
